Subject: [PATCH] mmc: dw_mmc: arm software DTO from CMD_DONE on writes

0060 armed DTO only from dw_mci_work_func wait sites. On Stamp-P4 SSH exec
the BH does not come back: leftover CMD53_BB can show cmd_done=1 with
data_over=0, and EASYSTICK_MMC TX_DRTO never prints through leftover.

Arm the existing dto_timer from the CMD_DONE IRQ after irq_lock is dropped
when the in-flight request is a write. dto_timer already synthesizes
SDMMC_INT_DRTO and queues BH.

Signed-off-by: EasyStick <dev@localhost>
---
diff --git a/drivers/mmc/host/dw_mmc.c b/drivers/mmc/host/dw_mmc.c
--- a/drivers/mmc/host/dw_mmc.c
+++ b/drivers/mmc/host/dw_mmc.c
@@ -2907,6 +2907,13 @@
 			dw_mci_cmd_interrupt(host, pending);
 
 			spin_unlock(&host->irq_lock);
+			/*
+			 * BH may never re-enter after CMD_DONE (observed hung CMD53
+			 * write: cmd_done=1, bh_in=1, data_over=0). Arm software DTO
+			 * here, after irq_lock, so dw_mci_set_drto() can take it.
+			 */
+			if (host->data && host->dir_status == DW_MCI_SEND_STATUS)
+				dw_mci_set_drto(host);
 		}
 
 		if (pending & SDMMC_INT_CD) {
